## Notes: Text and icon alerts for buffs and procs, placed wherever you want them.|nEach alert is one spell, shown as text, an icon, or both, with an optional sound or spoken cue.|nTells you up front which spells the game will let it read in a raid.|nSupports LibSharedMedia fonts and sounds.|nCreated by nugs.
